  character_Name: 
  character_Type: Average Joe
  character_Bio: "Living paycheck to paycheck, working at a corner store in the inner
    city, the most interesting parts of your day are the faces you commit to memory,
    and the new faces you have yet to memorize. Life is hard, and you rarely get
    breaks from its crushing weight, that is, until rumors of a potentially high-profit
    job start to circulate in your area, offering the kind of money that could have
    you set for a while. After some thought, you decide now is the big break you\u2019ve
    been waiting for, and step headfirst into your new career."
